# ============================================================
#  git/ transfer repo - what must never be committed
#  Only source (code + docs) is tracked. Real patient data and
#  regenerable build outputs stay out of version control.
# ============================================================

# ---- Real Infinity / patient data: NEVER commit ------------
# The 7 Infinity exports (and bai_list_of_orders_hist) go in
# PPR/July 27/data/. Only its README is tracked.
PPR/July 27/data/*
!PPR/July 27/data/README.md

# ---- Regenerable pipeline outputs (rebuilt by RUN_ALL.py) ---
PPR/July 27/analysis/
PPR/July 27/dashboard/
PPR/July 27/baseline/
PPR/July 27/decks/
*.hyper
*.log

# Synthetic sample lives on the Mac only, never shipped
synthetic_data/out/

# ---- OS / editor / Python noise ----------------------------
.DS_Store
~$*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
Meet/
